# Joe Fenix Method + Meal Prep Calculator

A comprehensive nutrition calculator that implements the Joe Fenix Method (BUILD. PROTECT. FUEL.) with integrated meal prep planning.

## Features

- Personalized daily macro targets based on activity level and goals
- Weekly meal planning with protein distribution across meals
- Integrated cookbook recipes (Quinoa & Spinach Frittata, Blueberry Almond Pancakes, Greek Yogurt Bowl)
- Smart grocery list generation
- 60-minute meal prep instructions
- Support for omnivore, vegetarian, and vegan preferences
- Health condition considerations (diabetes, hypertension, intolerances)
- Hydration tracking and BMI calculator
- Export to PDF, Word, and interactive web format

## The Joe Fenix Method (CORE)

- **BUILD** — Include protein at every meal
- **PROTECT** — Load your plate with vegetables and micronutrients
- **FUEL** — Add smart carbs and healthy fats

